---
layout: layout.njk
title: Nursing Notes
description: Comprehensive nursing study notes and summaries.
category: Nursing Notes
---

<div class="category-header">
    <div class="cat-icon">📒</div>
    <h1>Nursing Notes</h1>
    <p class="cat-desc">Comprehensive nursing study notes, chapter summaries, and quick revision guides covering all major nursing subjects. Perfect for exam preparation and last-minute revision for ANM, GNM, and BSc Nursing students.</p>
</div>

<div class="post-list">
{% set posts = collections.nursingNotes | reverse %}
{% for post in posts %}
    <div class="post-card">
        <div class="post-info">
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date.toLocaleDateString('en-IN') }} | {{ post.data.subject }}</p>
        </div>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn">View Notes</a>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
